Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00 

[HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\SOFTWARE\Microsoft\Windows\CurrentVersion\Explorer\Advanced\Folder\Hidden\SHOWALL] 

"CheckedValue"=dword:00000001



Many viruses modify system folder settings to hide themselves, preventing you from seeing hidden files through normal means.
Please ensure in “Folder Options” that you uncheck “Hide extensions for known file types”, double-click to run this file, then go back to “Folder Options” to set Show hidden files.